<title>BELGIUM: EU sees euro becoming major international currency.</title>
<headline>EU sees euro becoming major international currency.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A single European currency will gradually become a major international currency, the European Commission said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The development of the euro into a major international currency will be gradual, but relatively important in those countries which have close links with the EMU-participating countries,&quot; the Commission said in a report.</p>
</text>
